{"name":"lab-moon-orbit","kind":"lab","layout":"link","multifile":true,"editableBoundaries":false,"helpCategory":"HTML-CSS","challenges":[{"id":"66a37f37ef5823a313de8c26","title":"Build a Moon Orbit","dashedName":"build-a-moon-orbit","challengeType":25,"demoType":"onClick","description":[{"t":"p","c":["In this lab, you will create a simple animation of the Moon's orbit around the Earth using HTML and CSS. The Earth will be at the center of the system, and the Moon will orbit around it."]},{"t":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":["Objective:"]}," Fulfill the user stories below and get all the tests to pass to complete the lab."]},{"t":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":["User Stories:"]}]},{"t":"ol","items":[[{"t":"p","c":["You should align all the elements to the center of the page by setting the height to ",{"t":"code","v":"100%"}," of the viewport and setting a flexbox layout in the ",{"t":"code","v":"body"}," element."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":2,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["You should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," with the class ",{"t":"code","v":"space"},"."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":3,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["Inside the ",{"t":"code","v":".space"}," element, there should be two more ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," elements with the class ",{"t":"code","v":"earth"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"orbit"},", respectively, in order."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":4,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["Inside the ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element, there should be another ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," with the class ",{"t":"code","v":"moon"},"."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":5,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," element with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"space"}," should be centered on the page and have a width and height of ",{"t":"code","v":"200px"},"."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":6,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," element with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"space"}," should use ",{"t":"code","v":"relative"}," positioning."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":7,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element should use ",{"t":"code","v":"absolute"}," positioning. Position the center of the ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element at the halfway point of its parent on both the vertical (top) and horizontal (left) axes. After that, shift the ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element back by half its own width and height, to center it within its parent, the ",{"t":"code","v":".space"}," element."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":8,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element should have a width and height of ",{"t":"code","v":"100px"},"."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":9,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element should have a width and height of ",{"t":"code","v":"200px"},"."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":10,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element should be positioned using ",{"t":"code","v":"absolute"}," positioning. Its bottom right corner should be at the center of the ",{"t":"code","v":".space"}," element using a ",{"t":"code","v":"transform"}," property that shifts it by ",{"t":"code","v":"-50%"}," on both the vertical and horizontal axes."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":11,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The orbit path for the moon around the Earth should be a circle."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":12,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," element should be positioned using ",{"t":"code","v":"absolute"}," positioning and have a width and height of ",{"t":"code","v":"30px"},". The ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," element should position itself at the top of the ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element and be centered horizontally."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":13,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["You should further adjust the horizontal positioning of the ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," element by moving the element to the left by half of its width."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":14,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," selector should have a background color and a ",{"t":"code","v":"border-radius"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"50%"},"."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":15,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," selector should have a background color and a ",{"t":"code","v":"border-radius"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"50%"},"."]}]]},{"t":"ol","start":16,"items":[[{"t":"p","c":["You should define a ",{"t":"code","v":"@keyframes orbit"}," animation that rotates the ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element 360 degrees around its center. You should apply this animation to the ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element with a duration of ",{"t":"code","v":"5"}," seconds, a linear timing function, and infinite iterations."]}]]},{"t":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":["Note:"]}," Be sure to link your stylesheet in your HTML and apply your CSS."]}],"hints":[{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The contents of the ",{"t":"code","v":"body"}," element should be centered on the page by setting the height to ",{"t":"code","v":"100%"}," of the viewport height, ",{"t":"code","v":"display"}," to ",{"t":"code","v":"flex"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"justify-content"},", and ",{"t":"code","v":"align-items"}," to ",{"t":"code","v":"center"},"."]}],"test":"\nassert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('body')?.height, '100vh')\nassert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('body')?.display, 'flex');\nassert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('body')?.justifyContent, 'center');\nassert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('body')?.alignItems, 'center');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["You should have a main ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," with the class ",{"t":"code","v":"space"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(document.querySelector('div')?.getAttribute('class'), 'space');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".space"}," element should have a width and height of ",{"t":"code","v":"200px"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.space')?.width, '200px')\nassert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.space')?.height, '200px');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".space"}," element should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"position"}," property of ",{"t":"code","v":"relative"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.space')?.position, 'relative')"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["You should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," with a class of ",{"t":"code","v":"earth"}," inside the ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," with a ",{"t":"code","v":"class"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"space"},"."]}],"test":"assert.exists(document.querySelector('div.space div.earth'));"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element should be the first child of the ",{"t":"code","v":".space"}," element."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(document.querySelector('.space > div')?.getAttribute('class'), 'earth');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element should have a width and height of ",{"t":"code","v":"100px"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.earth')?.width, '100px');\nassert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.earth')?.height, '100px');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element should use ",{"t":"code","v":"absolute"}," positioning."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.earth')?.position, 'absolute');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"top"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"left"}," position of ",{"t":"code","v":"50%"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.earth')?.top, '50%') \nassert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.earth')?.left, '50%');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element should be moved back and up by ",{"t":"code","v":"50%"}," by setting the ",{"t":"code","v":"transform"}," property to ",{"t":"code","v":"translate(-50%, -50%)"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.earth')?.transform, 'translate(-50%, -50%)');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["You should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," with the class ",{"t":"code","v":"orbit"}," inside the ",{"t":"code","v":".space"}," element."]}],"test":"assert.exists(document.querySelector('div.space div.orbit'));"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element should come after the ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," element."]}],"test":"assert.isTrue(document.querySelector('.earth')?.nextElementSibling?.classList?.contains('orbit'));"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element should have a width and height of ",{"t":"code","v":"200px"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.orbit')?.width, '200px')\nassert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.orbit')?.height, '200px');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element should use ",{"t":"code","v":"absolute"}," positioning."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.orbit')?.position, 'absolute');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element should be positioned at the center of the ",{"t":"code","v":".space"}," element using a ",{"t":"code","v":"transform"}," property that shifts it by ",{"t":"code","v":"-50%"}," on both the vertical and horizontal axes."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.orbit')?.transform, 'translate(-50%, -50%)');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["You should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"div"}," with the class ",{"t":"code","v":"moon"}," inside the ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," element."]}],"test":"assert.exists(document.querySelector('div.space div.orbit div.moon'));"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," element should have a width and height of ",{"t":"code","v":"30px"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.moon')?.width, '30px') \nassert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.moon')?.height, '30px');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," element should be positioned using ",{"t":"code","v":"absolute"}," positioning."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.moon')?.position, 'absolute');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The top edge of the ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," element should be aligned with the top edge of its containing block."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.moon')?.top, '0px');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["You should move the left edge of the ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," element to the center of the containing block (",{"t":"code","v":"50%"}," from the left side)."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.moon')?.left, '50%');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," element should be adjusted horizontally by translating it to ",{"t":"code","v":"-50%"}," across the x-axis."]}],"test":"const transformValue = new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.moon')?.transform;\nconst validTransforms = ['translateX(-50%)', 'translate(-50%)'];\nassert.oneOf(transformValue, validTransforms);"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," selector should have a background color."]}],"test":"assert.isNotEmpty(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.earth')?.backgroundColor);"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".earth"}," selector should have ",{"t":"code","v":"border-radius"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"50%"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.earth')?.borderRadius, '50%');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," selector should have a background color."]}],"test":"assert.isNotEmpty(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.moon')?.backgroundColor);"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"code","v":".moon"}," selector should have ",{"t":"code","v":"border-radius"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"50%"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.moon')?.borderRadius, '50%');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["You should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"@keyframes"}," rule."]}],"test":"assert.lengthOf(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getCSSRules('keyframes'), 1);"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["Your new ",{"t":"code","v":"@keyframes"}," rule should be named ",{"t":"code","v":"orbit"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getCSSRules('keyframes')?.[0]?.name, 'orbit');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["Your ",{"t":"code","v":"@keyframes orbit"}," rule should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"0%"}," selector."]}],"test":"const rules = new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getCSSRules('keyframes')?.[0]?.cssRules; \nassert.strictEqual(rules?.[0]?.keyText, '0%');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["Your ",{"t":"code","v":"@keyframes orbit"}," rule should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"100%"}," selector."]}],"test":"const rules = new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getCSSRules('keyframes')?.[0]?.cssRules\nassert.isTrue(rules?.[0]?.keyText === '100%' || rules?.[1]?.keyText === '100%');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["Your ",{"t":"code","v":"0%"}," selector should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"transform"}," property set to ",{"t":"code","v":"rotate(0deg) translate(-50%, -50%)"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getCSSRules('keyframes')?.[0]?.cssRules?.[0]?.style?.transform, 'rotate(0deg) translate(-50%, -50%)');"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["Your ",{"t":"code","v":"100%"}," selector should come after your ",{"t":"code","v":"0%"}," selector."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getCSSRules('keyframes')?.[0]?.cssRules?.[1]?.keyText, '100%')"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["Your ",{"t":"code","v":"100%"}," selector should have a ",{"t":"code","v":"transform"}," property set to ",{"t":"code","v":"rotate(360deg) translate(-50%, -50%)"},"."]}],"test":"assert.strictEqual(new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getCSSRules('keyframes')?.[0]?.cssRules?.[1]?.style?.transform, 'rotate(360deg) translate(-50%, -50%)')"},{"text":[{"t":"p","c":["Your ",{"t":"code","v":".orbit"}," selector should have an ",{"t":"code","v":"animation"}," property set to ",{"t":"code","v":"orbit 5s linear infinite"},"."]}],"test":"\nconst orbitStyles = new __helpers.CSSHelp(document).getStyle('.orbit');\nassert.strictEqual(orbitStyles?.animationName, \"orbit\");\nassert.strictEqual(orbitStyles?.animationDuration, \"5s\");\nassert.strictEqual(orbitStyles?.animationTimingFunction, \"linear\");\nassert.strictEqual(orbitStyles?.animationIterationCount, \"infinite\");\n"}],"seed":{"files":[{"lang":"html","contents":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <title>Moon Orbit</title>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>"},{"lang":"css","contents":""}]},"solutions":[{"lang":"html","contents":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Moon Orbiting Earth</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"space\">\n        <div class=\"earth\"></div>\n        <div class=\"orbit\">\n            <div class=\"moon\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>"},{"lang":"css","contents":"body {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    height: 100vh;\n    margin: 0;\n    background-color: #000;\n}\n\n.space {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 200px;\n    height: 200px;\n}\n\n.earth {\n    width: 100px;\n    height: 100px;\n    background-color: blue;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.5);\n}\n\n.orbit {\n    width: 200px;\n    height: 200px;\n    position: absolute;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    animation: orbit 5s linear infinite;\n}\n\n.moon {\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 30px;\n    background-color: gray;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgb(255, 255, 255);\n}\n\n\n@keyframes orbit {\n    0% {\n        transform: rotate(0deg) translate(-50%, -50%);\n    }\n\n    100% {\n        transform: rotate(360deg) translate(-50%, -50%);\n    }\n}"}]}]}